WEBVTT

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:03.240
Queen's Blade.

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:05.610
Two heroines, guided by fate...

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:07.440
have cast aside their former friendship...

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:12.120
in order to resolve themselves to compete for the one and only position of Queen.

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:15.720
Not even the gods can predict the outcome of this battle.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:18.370
Another cup!

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:20.450
Hey! Are you listening?

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:22.730
Another cup!

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:24.290
Yes! Right away!

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:26.240
Nanael-sama,

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:28.410
don't you think you've had a bit too much to drink?

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:29.570
Huh?

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:32.240
If you drink so much milk...

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:34.050
your stomach will burst.

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:40.140
The precious divine milk that the Head Angel entrusted me with was stolen by that flabby pink!

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:43.000
I can't return to heaven like this!

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.440
Just let me drink!

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:47.560
Hey! Where's my refill?

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:49.940
Sorry for the wait!

00:01:03.410 --> 00:01:05.670
N-Nanael-sama!

00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:08.130
I-I-I-I'm sorry...

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:09.650
I'll kill you!

00:01:12.070 --> 00:01:14.050
I'm sorry!

00:01:15.010 --> 00:01:22.060
The sky will not fall, the sea will not dry, and the earth will not split.

00:01:22.060 --> 00:01:28.690
I am prepared to offer my life.

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:42.120
Just as I can see no end to this sky,

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:49.040
I inherit the will and strength that will exist forever.

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:55.380
With each person carrying different feelings in their heart,

00:01:55.380 --> 00:02:03.100
When the time comes, they will fulfill their promise with that special someone.

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:07.520
In order to become

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:12.690
the chosen ruler of this world,

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:16.780
I will shake off any pain I feel.

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:24.040
The sky will not fall, the sea will not drought, and the earth will not split.

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:30.080
I am prepared to offer my life.

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:37.090
No one shall stop me on my path.

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:52.110
A monster?

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:53.440
Yes.

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:57.490
A monster with horns on its head appeared near the center of the forest.

00:02:57.490 --> 00:03:00.030
Oh, how dreadful!

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:02.960
A monster with horns on its head...

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:07.500
Hey... couldn't that be flabby pink?

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:10.370
It must be her.

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:12.000
That settles it!

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:33.990
The Vance province has readied its army.

00:03:34.640 --> 00:03:37.610
Oh, Onee-sama? You're awake?

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:41.200
I was having a dream.

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:44.350
Inside the ancient Vance castle...

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:47.780
you were braiding Leina's hair.

00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:52.090
And I was drinking tea with Father.

00:03:52.090 --> 00:03:53.700
That's what I saw.

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:55.300
Say, Onee-sama...

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:59.140
Can't we continue living here after Queen's Blade ends?

00:03:59.140 --> 00:04:01.000
The three of us, together...

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:03.540
Return to the Vance family, Elina.

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:04.260
Eh?

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:08.130
I cannot return there anymore...

00:04:08.130 --> 00:04:09.800
nor do I have the intention to.

00:04:10.570 --> 00:04:12.050
Neither does Leina, most likely...

00:04:12.050 --> 00:04:14.690
No, absolutely not!

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:16.880
Who cares about the Vance family?

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:19.530
I want to be by Onee-chan's side.

00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:21.240
There is no one else but you...

00:04:21.890 --> 00:04:25.490
Won't you stand next to our father in my stead?

00:04:28.020 --> 00:04:31.870
That would benefit Leina more than anything else.

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:33.830
Elina.

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:36.060
I wish for you to also become an adult, gradually...

00:04:36.060 --> 00:04:37.850
I know that!

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:40.740
I know, but...

00:04:47.590 --> 00:04:51.930
Hey, hey, hey! Flabby pink! Show yourself!

00:04:58.990 --> 00:05:00.620
Nanael-sama.

00:05:00.620 --> 00:05:02.150
Please be careful.

00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:05.770
If you come any closer...

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:10.060
I fear I may cut you down.

00:05:11.360 --> 00:05:13.570
Eh? You're...

00:05:14.190 --> 00:05:15.320
Tomoe-san?

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:24.560
Which means the rumors about the monster were regarding Tomoe-san.

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:26.850
However...

00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:30.470
You are training with considerable zeal.

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:33.940
This is way more than zeal...

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:35.270
This isn't normal!

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:40.230
Isn't this pretty bad for Leina?

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:50.660
The chosen one for this occasion is...

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:52.610
The Vagrant Warrior...

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:55.620
Leina onee-chan!

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:56.370
Elina?

00:05:58.320 --> 00:06:01.310
Onee-chan, you look so surprised!

00:06:01.310 --> 00:06:03.120
O-Of course I do!

00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:06.610
I don't know when I'll be called for the next battle, after all!

00:06:06.610 --> 00:06:08.370
It's alright!

00:06:08.370 --> 00:06:10.390
I know you'll win, Onee-chan.

00:06:11.090 --> 00:06:13.580
How is Claudette doing?

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:17.500
She's completely fine. She's already lively again.

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:20.120
Is that so? Thank goodness...

00:06:20.120 --> 00:06:22.370
H-Hey! What are you doing?

00:06:22.370 --> 00:06:25.220
Hey, Onee-chan, haven't you lost some weight?

00:06:25.220 --> 00:06:27.820
That tickles... let go!

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:32.540
Look, you used to be a lot softer here...

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:33.740
Hey! Sto-

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:37.340
Elina! Cut it out already!

00:06:39.130 --> 00:06:42.830
Just leave, already. I'm trying to concentrate on my next battle.

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:46.260
Alright, I understand.

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:50.780
You can call me anytime if you're longing for me, alright?

00:06:50.780 --> 00:06:52.180
I won't long for you!

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:53.310
See you!

00:06:58.950 --> 00:06:59.390
Let's go.

00:07:00.970 --> 00:07:03.610
Is this alright with you, Elina-sama?

00:07:05.390 --> 00:07:08.320
Don't say such tedious things. We're moving out!

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:09.070
Ah, understood!

00:07:10.050 --> 00:07:13.530
We are now returning to castle Vance with Elina-sama!

00:07:14.360 --> 00:07:16.610
Goodbye, Onee-chan.

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:25.360
Thank you, Elina.

00:07:25.360 --> 00:07:28.830
The chosen one for this occasion is: Vagrant Warrior, Leina!

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:31.220
Just kidding! Did I surprise you?

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:33.950
Of course you did! I don't know when I'll be called-

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:35.970
I know, I know.

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:37.800
Don't say any more.

00:07:37.800 --> 00:07:42.980
I thought I'd tell you something nice today, alright?

00:07:44.720 --> 00:07:45.850
Something nice?

00:07:47.220 --> 00:07:49.400
Whatever, just come with me!

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:51.320
I said I don't want to!

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:52.990
Why not?

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:54.760
Isn't it obvious?!

00:07:54.760 --> 00:07:58.570
Trying to catch Tomoe off guard with a surprise attack... just what kind of an idea is that?

00:07:58.570 --> 00:08:01.090
I'm just looking out for you!

00:08:01.090 --> 00:08:04.500
You see... I really want my beloved Leina-chan to win!

00:08:05.110 --> 00:08:06.970
You're definitely lying!

00:08:06.970 --> 00:08:08.620
I'm not lying!

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:13.380
If Leina doesn't win, things won't look good for me.

00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:17.310
Letting the divine milk get stolen was bad enough...

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:22.630
Anyway, Tomoe's been sitting there all this time with her eyes closed.

00:08:22.630 --> 00:08:26.060
She should be exhausted by now; it'll be an easy win if you get her in her sleep!

00:08:26.060 --> 00:08:28.820
That isn't the problem here!

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:33.030
Leina, don't you want to win?

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:34.490
I want to win!

00:08:35.060 --> 00:08:39.160
Well, aren't I giving you a way to do that?

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:40.610
No!

00:08:40.610 --> 00:08:44.580
I'm saying that I don't want to use such cowardly methods to win.

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:48.790
Come!

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:49.460
Huh?!

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:51.000
I don't want to!

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:52.200
C-Come on!

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:52.910
No!

00:08:52.910 --> 00:08:55.920
What are they doing? They sure are noisy.

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:01.850
So is it tastier than the strawberry flavored one?

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:04.480
You don't drink divine milk!

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:07.350
Don't confuse it with goat milk, okay?

00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:10.270
So it really was that important?

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:11.730
That's right.

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:16.320
That divine milk has the effect of taking away the strength of heaven's residents.

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:20.280
And Melona was revived when she was splashed with it...

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:22.500
Melona's still alive?

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:23.810
The problem is...

00:09:23.810 --> 00:09:29.400
Flabby pink said that the Queen stood up, frightened, when she saw the divine milk.

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:33.960
According to my sharp reasoning, she's probably...

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:39.220
Being possessed by someone from heaven, right?

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:43.270
Don't spoil the answer to our long-awaited riddle!

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:44.930
Anyone would have known that.

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:48.630
Even so...

00:09:48.630 --> 00:09:52.190
Why do I have to catch Tomoe off guard with a surprise attack?

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:56.860
Like I said, because I want you to win, Leina-chan...

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:58.780
Enough already...

00:09:58.780 --> 00:10:02.120
Besides, Tomoe isn't an opponent that you can defeat with a surprise attack!

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:05.690
No, no, no... if you sneak up from behind, you can get her!

00:10:05.690 --> 00:10:07.370
She's all alone, after all.

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:08.210
Eh?

00:10:08.910 --> 00:10:09.750
She's alone?

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:33.360
Anyway, I'll show you I can win without using such a cowardly trick!

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:36.660
Of course! I'd be in trouble if you didn't win properly!

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:38.730
I must prepare for my business rivalry!

00:10:38.730 --> 00:10:41.280
You'll definitely... you'll definitely win, right?

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:43.370
Oh, Rana, where are you going?

00:10:43.850 --> 00:10:47.100
Um... I have to pee.

00:10:47.100 --> 00:10:49.200
That's the wrong way, then.

00:10:50.340 --> 00:10:52.090
Oh yeah...

00:10:52.090 --> 00:10:54.120
The chosen one for this occasion is:

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:56.460
Vagrant Warrior, Leina.

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:57.050
There it is!

00:10:57.740 --> 00:11:01.050
When you have prepared yourself, pass through the gate.

00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:05.990
This is...

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:16.680
Hinomoto?

00:11:25.090 --> 00:11:27.410
This is my birthplace.

00:11:28.260 --> 00:11:31.740
A place where many friends and sisters are resting in peace...

00:11:32.380 --> 00:11:33.450
And...

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:38.290
My sole purpose for fighting.

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:40.750
Tomoe...

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:50.600
That's...

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:52.990
the horned monster.

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:12.640
Forward!

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:17.040
What amazing spirit...

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:19.800
Ahem!

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:23.590
Come, come, everyone! Don't miss this opportunity!

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:28.560
Right now, we're on the verge of a snow white Queen's Blade battle!

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:31.660
Here we have the Hinomoto Warrior Shrine Maiden, Tomoe.

00:12:31.660 --> 00:12:34.190
Why is her hair snow white!?

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:35.850
There are horns on her forehead, too!

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:39.690
Opposing her is: Vagrant Warrior Leina!

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:41.820
Come now, everyone!

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:45.500
Direct your attention to the sword in which the Vagrant Warrior, Leina, holds!

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:48.420
Its name is the Blade of Ewindel!

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:52.750
This is Tomoe's true strength...

00:12:56.580 --> 00:12:57.820
Warrior Kick!

00:13:07.170 --> 00:13:08.320
Leina!

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:11.580
Onee-chan!

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:20.150
As I thought, it seems that the Warrior Shrine Maiden, Tomoe, is completely dominant.

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:22.630
Of course.

00:13:27.630 --> 00:13:31.210
An abundance of departed souls lie there.

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:33.790
Yes...

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:36.670
The ghosts which are starting to awaken,

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:41.210
are entwining themselves with Tomoe's arms, legs, and head.

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:43.330
Encompassing her entire body.

00:13:45.890 --> 00:13:48.340
And her soul is completely empty.

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:53.330
Tomoe herself is not even aware of the weight of her suffering.

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:59.230
That suffering, the pain in her heart,
gives birth to an unprecedented strength?

00:14:01.170 --> 00:14:02.760
That's right.

00:14:02.760 --> 00:14:06.320
It would be impossible for Tomoe to be defeated as she is now.

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:14.230
She can't even get a solid hit in.

00:14:14.230 --> 00:14:17.260
I knew it was impossible without a surprise attack.

00:14:18.130 --> 00:14:21.090
Yes! My Blade of Ewindel!

00:14:21.770 --> 00:14:23.960
What strong craftsmanship!

00:14:24.570 --> 00:14:28.560
What a reliable sword to have in such a battle!

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:29.640
Nonsense.{Rubbish... if you want to get literal.. idiot stench ;)}

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:37.060
Take a look at this sword, a custom made Steel Mountain blade!

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:40.540
Oh, it's a dwarven sword.

00:14:40.540 --> 00:14:42.400
Doesn't it look pretty cool?

00:14:43.810 --> 00:14:45.680
I've got a good feeling.

00:15:06.730 --> 00:15:09.010
She's manipulating the wind!

00:15:10.160 --> 00:15:11.470
This wind is...

00:15:12.620 --> 00:15:14.920
the hope of my fallen sisters.

00:15:14.920 --> 00:15:15.920
As well as...

00:15:16.910 --> 00:15:20.180
Shizuka-san's strong feelings,
whom I murdered with these hands.

00:15:20.180 --> 00:15:21.770
Eh? Murdered?

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:23.440
Murdered Shizuka?!

00:15:24.420 --> 00:15:25.400
You did?!

00:15:26.710 --> 00:15:27.900
That can't be!

00:15:29.980 --> 00:15:35.810
Even at the end of her life, Shizuka-san was instructing me.

00:15:36.340 --> 00:15:41.440
In your coming battles, fight as fiercely as you did now.

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:42.040
Shizuka-san!

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:43.890
Don't cry.

00:15:43.890 --> 00:15:44.460
Yes...

00:15:46.030 --> 00:15:49.390
This is the only thing I have left for you to remember me by.

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:53.490
I made a vow to Shizuka-san...

00:15:53.490 --> 00:15:55.630
That I would become a demon...

00:15:55.630 --> 00:16:00.410
That I would not let any doubt or compassion hinder me in my battles...

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:03.520
That I would cast aside my timid heart...

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:06.570
and merely cut down the enemies in front of me.

00:16:17.130 --> 00:16:19.160
Warrior Shrine Maiden technique!

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:21.410
Helmet Slice!

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:23.170
Dragon Tail!

00:16:27.060 --> 00:16:30.200
Ah! My Blade of Ewindel!

00:16:30.200 --> 00:16:33.290
The specially made, dwarven Blade of Ewindel!

00:16:33.290 --> 00:16:36.470
Hey, will Onee-chan be all right?

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:39.130
What incredible splendor!

00:16:39.130 --> 00:16:42.340
What incredible durability!

00:16:42.340 --> 00:16:45.610
It looks like Leina is losing!

00:16:45.610 --> 00:16:46.520
Hey!

00:16:47.150 --> 00:16:49.830
What is it? You're really annoying.

00:16:49.830 --> 00:16:50.440
But...

00:16:52.820 --> 00:16:54.200
Is this for real?

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:56.620
The one with the dwarven sword collapsed!

00:16:56.620 --> 00:17:02.540
Ah! I wonder if it's about the time for my Blade of Ewindel to make a comeback?

00:17:03.070 --> 00:17:04.760
Is this really the end?

00:17:04.760 --> 00:17:08.090
It is, it is! Warrior Shrine Maiden Tomoe's going to end it!

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:12.450
I wonder when she's going to get serious?

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:16.050
Soon... soon...

00:17:16.980 --> 00:17:21.050
Get it together! What the hell are you doing?

00:17:21.050 --> 00:17:25.290
The true power of your sword is something much greater than that!

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:26.810
Leina!

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:34.730
I can't afford to lose, either.

00:17:41.940 --> 00:17:44.410
That radiance... don't tell me...

00:17:45.060 --> 00:17:46.590
It seems that it is, somehow.

00:17:47.090 --> 00:17:49.040
It can't be...

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:52.060
Siren Warrior Kick!

00:17:54.640 --> 00:17:55.860
Tomoe.

00:17:55.860 --> 00:17:57.510
No matter what memories you hold...

00:17:57.510 --> 00:17:59.640
Rotating Kick!

00:18:00.600 --> 00:18:02.360
No matter how great your burden...

00:18:03.140 --> 00:18:05.880
No matter who has called you to fight...

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:09.380
Moonlit Sword Decapitation!

00:18:11.380 --> 00:18:12.620
I...

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:15.680
I...

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:21.490
I will accept it all!

00:18:23.900 --> 00:18:25.240
Absurdity!

00:18:25.240 --> 00:18:29.180
Battle begets only victory or defeat, and only death awaits the defeated!

00:18:30.400 --> 00:18:32.380
Warrior Shrine Maiden Paper Charm Technique!

00:18:33.890 --> 00:18:35.200
Living Spirit...

00:18:36.470 --> 00:18:39.320
Whirlwind Chain!

00:18:40.450 --> 00:18:44.600
I will even accept your wishes!

00:19:18.280 --> 00:19:19.380
Thank you.

00:19:21.250 --> 00:19:23.270
I was so happy...

00:19:23.270 --> 00:19:25.970
that I could fight seriously with you, Tomoe.

00:19:25.970 --> 00:19:27.270
Thank you.

00:19:27.660 --> 00:19:29.040
Leina-san.

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:35.530
Through people like you, I have finally come to understand these feelings.

00:19:43.010 --> 00:19:45.300
I'm sure you'll forgive me...

00:19:46.150 --> 00:19:47.600
Shizuka-san.

00:19:52.060 --> 00:19:56.290
Really, that Leina... That was so close, I could barely watch!

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:57.920
Hey, I'll take one!

00:19:57.920 --> 00:20:00.010
That dwarven sword turned everything around!

00:20:01.530 --> 00:20:04.640
You saw it, didn't you? The might of the Blade of Ewindel!

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:06.580
Come now, everyone!

00:20:06.580 --> 00:20:10.670
The Blade of Ewindel that the very Vagrant Warrior, Leina, was wielding!

00:20:10.670 --> 00:20:15.000
If you purchase it now, you'll get it at an amazingly low price! What a great treasure!

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:16.150
Give me one!

00:20:16.150 --> 00:20:16.980
Me, too!

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:21.890
But this material is different from Leina's.

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:25.490
Don't push, don't push!

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:28.910
You did it, Leina!

00:20:28.910 --> 00:20:32.480
You really are something special...

00:20:32.480 --> 00:20:33.330
Leina.

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:39.200
Isn't it great that Leina won?

00:20:39.200 --> 00:20:41.720
I'm really happy!

00:20:42.570 --> 00:20:44.840
What? You need to pee again?

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:46.720
That's all you do, seriously.

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:50.450
Eh? I haven't gone yet today.

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:52.330
How could that be?!

00:20:52.330 --> 00:20:55.080
Didn't you just go a little while ago?

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:57.400
But I've been sleeping the whole time.

00:20:58.020 --> 00:21:01.320
He sure says some strange things.

00:21:07.180 --> 00:21:11.210
Following that idiot angel was the right choice.

00:21:11.210 --> 00:21:15.270
Aldra, I think I understand what you are.

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:18.460
The next time you let your guard down...

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:26.320
This is...

00:21:26.320 --> 00:21:27.390
You regained consciousness?

00:21:29.230 --> 00:21:30.760
Queen Aldra?

00:21:31.400 --> 00:21:33.460
We finally meet...

00:21:33.460 --> 00:21:35.230
Champion of Hinomoto...

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:36.700
Warrior Shrine Maiden, Tomoe.

00:21:42.300 --> 00:21:43.280
Setora?

00:21:43.430 --> 00:21:44.530
Setora?

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:48.530
Strange, he left me again and went off somewhere by himself.

00:21:48.530 --> 00:21:54.160
I'm always doing my best to revive my great kingdom!

00:21:54.160 --> 00:21:58.000
Come now, bow down before the great Kingdom of Amara!

00:21:58.580 --> 00:22:00.540
Swamp Witch.

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:02.170
An eerie existence.

00:22:02.170 --> 00:22:04.060
Well, we're all girls of the underworld.

00:22:04.060 --> 00:22:05.760
Majestic orders.

00:22:05.760 --> 00:22:07.590
Oh, Swamp Witch.

00:22:07.590 --> 00:22:08.930
Such erotic actions.

00:22:08.930 --> 00:22:10.600
We'll truly show our love for you.

00:22:10.600 --> 00:22:11.390
Yes.

00:22:11.390 --> 00:22:13.720
The three of us will all serve you.

00:22:13.720 --> 00:22:14.470
Really?

00:22:14.470 --> 00:22:15.350
Most likely.

00:22:15.350 --> 00:22:18.140
Girls, let's all do our jobs properly.

00:22:18.140 --> 00:22:20.650
It's Menace, sorry to keep you waiting!

00:22:20.650 --> 00:22:23.070
I'm the princess of the Amara Kingdom.

00:22:23.070 --> 00:22:25.370
For as long as I please, I won't hold back

00:22:25.370 --> 00:22:27.780
In making you bow to my great authority.

00:22:27.780 --> 00:22:30.130
No matter how much time may pass,

00:22:30.130 --> 00:22:32.550
I'm a flower that will never wither.

00:22:32.550 --> 00:22:34.740
Well then, let me show you

00:22:34.740 --> 00:22:37.750
The proof that I live up to my name.

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:42.500
The living scepter, Setra, is her companion.

00:22:42.500 --> 00:22:49.970
They're an ancient combination, here they go!

00:22:49.970 --> 00:22:53.100
I have a majestic body.

00:22:53.100 --> 00:22:55.600
I'll get you with my fatal Royal Headbutt!

00:22:55.600 --> 00:22:57.770
Pathetic traffic.

00:22:57.770 --> 00:22:59.900
And finally, Shining Pyramid.

00:22:59.900 --> 00:23:02.650
Then, you should pass away slowly

00:23:02.650 --> 00:23:05.320
Bound with cursed bandages.

00:23:05.320 --> 00:23:07.320
You'll feel a great history

00:23:07.320 --> 00:23:10.200
In a dream you will never wake from.

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:17.830
Your caution and composure really yielded some great results!

00:23:17.830 --> 00:23:22.130
But even with your overwhelming talent, you're nothing compared to Nanael-san!

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:26.130
And that hopeless rat, Leina, still has two opponents left to face the Queen.

00:23:26.130 --> 00:23:27.670
Well, it's alright, I guess.

00:23:27.670 --> 00:23:31.130
Anybody with a support of an Angel, can manage to become a queen!{Even with her incompetence, she did manage to beat an angel, so she might be the horse to bet on!}

00:23:31.130 --> 00:23:34.470
If Leina becomes Queen, maybe I'll make her
into my puppet, or use her for money making.

00:23:34.470 --> 00:23:36.770
Ah, geez! I can't stop these wild ideas!

00:23:36.770 --> 00:23:39.100
Next time: Bloody Battle! Focal Showdown!

00:23:39.100 --> 00:23:41.350
The opponent is the gorilla girl of darkness, Risty!

00:23:41.350 --> 00:23:43.400
Power overwhelming!
